    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s not just about the career. it’s the quiet. everything is so quiet now. i try to think about rebuilding but there's nothing left to build on. it's like the foundation itself turned to dust. i'm just tired of trying to find a reason to keep going when the person who had those reasons doesn't even exist anymore.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
