      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That quiet isn't emptiness—it's the sound of your old self finally shutting up so something new can speak. You don't need a foundation; you need to lay one brick at a time, even if it's just getting out of bed. The person who had those reasons is gone, but you're still here to write new ones, even if they're small and shaky. Tiredness is just the body asking you to rest, not to quit.",
